355a7419-41b5-4c7a-9ae2-21ed2951d70e	If you built it over time, because I know brands are built over time, right? Brands in people's minds, how people perceive brands, right? If you built up your personal brand or your business's brand with two hours of content each day, it would take you 150-ish days. So that's like half a year, right? Straight uploading two hours of content across four different platforms or any type of platform for straight up 150-ish days, right? Which would be a good, ideal, optimal amount. Now, in order to pull that off, I don't know, your personal brand and your business would need a content strategy. And that's different across every case, right? And that's like, basically, what is the most amount of value with the least amount of effort with the maximum amount of positive result that a personal brand or a business could do? And that's different for everybody. So that's gonna be for y'all to figure out. Good luck with that. But here is a good number to aim towards, two hours a day for 150-ish days. And that's the number I just found out. So if you want some customers, some clients, some leads, some acquisitions, aim for that number of 154 days of uploading two hours of content a day.	{"Content Strategy","Personal Branding","Business Growth","Social Media Marketing"}	{"If you built it over time...","two hours of content each day","150-ish days","aim for that number of 154 days"}	educational	medium	{"0:00": "Introduction to the concept of building a brand over time", "1:15": "Revelation of the two-hour daily content strategy", "2:30": "Explanation of the need for a tailored content strategy", "3:45": "Final encouragement and call to action"}	65	3.0	2025-12-25 00:47:51.951113+00	{"mood": "casual and contemplative", "colors": ["gray", "maroon", "light brown"], "frame_count": 5, "deep_analysis": {"title": "Casual Indoor Snapshot with Focus", "people": [{"position": "centered", "body_pose": "standing, upper body visible", "person_id": 1, "accessor