9a1ba7c5-98d1-4a33-9505-c761090cf6cf	that's interesting about social media is that it's always better with the business right and then once you get the context that people on social media they're trying to guide people towards their business it all starts to make sense this is especially true in the AI and automation space which makes it frustrating especially for me because I'm a quick learner but the amount of content that you have to produce talking about the same thing over and over again and putting that on social media just to show other people that you are competent and this skill set is crazy I feel like I've you know if I could say it once I could say a thousand times but that necessarily isn't the case on social media because you get lost really easily in the crowd full of people they're always saying the same thing over and over and over again right so honestly social media is a game of just who can push out the most content talking about the same things addressing different audiences over and over and over again right it's become a game of that right because now everybody can publish thousands of videos every single day so I know I remember a couple months ago 43 million reels were uploaded to Instagram every single day that's not numbers projected to go up and you know with months coming in the future and all itself right because of you know advancement of AI and technology and ease of access and technology right so just imagine yourself like posting the same video millions of times a day just to get your business off the ground that's literally what people are gonna have to go through now which is crazy so like I'm trying to logically see through it but it's like the more the most and the more like organic and more creative your videos are the more they'll stand out and the more that people recognize that and that's what I think I'll try to strive for in this next quarter of content creation right I first tested content at scale that did well then I te